  "ingredients": [
    "2 medium russet potatoes, shredded",
    "0.5 medium onion, finely chopped",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 egg",
    "1 cup oil for frying, or as needed",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vss2dlFr0taWQg4iRuI8YcWf-4w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/57783-Emilys-Famous-Hash-Browns-Step-001-a6ba1003c7d143dcbe8cad7c65924cca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57783/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse shredded potatoes until water is clear, then drain and squeeze dry. Place shreds in a bowl and mix in the onion, flour, and egg until evenly distributed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BklbouZYp7ISkC7-2ifpvzQsZuQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/57783-Emilys-Famous-Hash-Browns-Step-002-be81bda2d6bc4d6fa5ef900dfd192328.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57783/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat about 1/4 inch of oil in a large heavy skillet over medium-high heat. When oil is sizzling hot, place potatoes into the pan in a 1/2-inch thick layer. Cover the whole bottom of the pan, or make separate piles like pancakes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pmRyXwI95ziaAzk5-SHjUd5EBeI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/57783-Emilys-Famous-Hash-Browns-Step-007-fa596b044981400bad6b3914609e7e68.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57783/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook until nicely browned on the bottom, then flip over and brown on the other side. It should take at least 5 minutes per side. If you are cooking them in one big piece, it can be cut into quarters for easier flipping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9_y2Yi1Oy2sJsiwoiY_plCBRazE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/57783-Emilys-Famous-Hash-Browns-Step-010-a80db978586446e9a8b5bd29d043288d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57783/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from pan, and drain on paper towels. Season with salt and pepper and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LTLfTMxt-tPQKtRbrjBkUOnxJIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/57783-Emilys-Famous-Hash-Browns-Step-012-216faa23397e43ee8bc06ef2ca5b5a7c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57783/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3FXvOnlaER8gcmZA2X-SyjyU9Mo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/57783-emilys-famous-hash-browns-DDMFS-4x3-ce2a6ec1178640258faf601d6848ff11.jpg"
      ],
